description	"The MagnaGuard

The classic star wars magna guard. A droid weilding an electrostaff with a backup pistol for firefights. 

^2Weaponry:
- Electrostaff
-- Saber / Blaster Defense (2)
- Bulldog RLR (PLX-2M 3)
-- 100% More DMG
-- 70% Less Velocity
-- 15% Slower Movement
-- 3 Shots Per Clip
-- 280% Longer Mag Reload

^5Powers:
- Jump (1)

^8Attributes:
- BP Free Jumps
- Force Block (1)
- Close Combat Training (1)
- 1 Reinforcement (CTF: 20s Respawn)

^2Strengths^7: Mixes use of blaster weaponry with decent armor and the ability to hold one's own in a duel with a jedi.
^1Weaknesses^7: Lacks any long range weaponry, not particularly superior in any regard."